FOR BOTH CASES: Wing is built into the fuselage with a 4 Degrees incidence angle
Re=140k report is the case that includes L/D = 9.
Re=217k report has L/D=11.5, however initial condition of omega was set incorrectly. 
To run either case, adjust velocity in 0/include/initialConditions and system/forceCoeffs, corresponding wall-functions for 0/omega and 0/nut as well as turbulentKE and turbulentOmega in 0/include/initialConditions accordingly in each case.
turbulentKE and turbulentOmega match velocity for a 5% turbulence intensity inlet, which is used for urban air settings.
